# StreamCraft.Forms - Windows Forms Implementation Details

_A comprehensive specification for recreating Windows Forms desktop experience in React using XML_

---

## Current State Analysis

### What We Have Implemented

#### 1. Core Infrastructure
- ✅ XML parser and renderer (`xmlView.ts`)
- ✅ Control registry system (`controls/index.ts`)
- ✅ Per-control modular architecture (`controls/*.tsx`)
- ✅ Layout/style resolution helpers (`core.tsx`)
- ✅ Draggable container system
- ✅ Canvas scaling (1920×1080)

#### 2. Controls Implemented
- ✅ **Window** - Main window with title bar, configurable buttons (_□X)
- ✅ **Panel** - Container with optional title, configurable buttons
- ✅ **PanelContainer** - Layout container
- ✅ **View** - Generic container
- ✅ **Dock** - Docking container
- ✅ **MenuBar** - Top menu bar
- ✅ **MenuItem** - Menu items
- ✅ **Canvas** - Drawing surface
- ✅ **Grid** - Overlay grid
- ✅ **Element** - Generic HTML element renderer
- ✅ **Text** - Text node renderer
- ✅ **Template/Use** - Reusable template system

#### 3. Theming System
- ✅ CDN-based themes (98.css, XP.css, 7.css, etc.)
- ✅ Icon packs with CSS Modules
- ✅ Developer toolkit (`window.debug`)
- ✅ Theme switching UI

#### 4. Layout Features
- ✅ Absolute positioning via CSS
- ✅ Basic draggable windows
- ✅ Z-index management (implicit)
- ✅ Style props on controls
- ⚠️ **Partial**: Dock/Anchor (CSS-based, not property-driven)

### What's Missing from WinForms

#### 1. Essential Input Controls
- ❌ **Label** - Static text display
- ❌ **TextBox** - Single/multi-line input
- ❌ **Button** - Clickable button with events
- ❌ **CheckBox** - Boolean toggle
- ❌ **RadioButton** - Exclusive selection
- ❌ **ComboBox** - Dropdown selection
- ❌ **ListBox** - List selection
- ❌ **NumericUpDown** - Numeric input with spinner
- ❌ **DateTimePicker** - Date/time selection
- ❌ **PictureBox** - Image display

#### 2. Advanced Controls
- ❌ **DataGridView** - Tabular data display/edit
- ❌ **TreeView** - Hierarchical data
- ❌ **ProgressBar** - Progress indicator
- ❌ **TrackBar** - Slider
- ❌ **TabControl** - Tabbed interface
- ❌ **ToolStrip** - Toolbar
- ❌ **StatusStrip** - Status bar
- ❌ **RichTextBox** - Formatted text

#### 3. Layout Containers
- ❌ **FlowLayoutPanel** - Auto-flow layout (horizontal/vertical)
- ❌ **TableLayoutPanel** - Grid-based layout
- ❌ **SplitContainer** - Resizable split panes
- ❌ **GroupBox** - Bordered group with label

#### 4. Dialog/Form Features
- ❌ **Modal dialogs** - Blocking ShowDialog()
- ❌ **Dialog results** - OK/Cancel/Yes/No
- ❌ **Form lifecycle events** - Load, Shown, Closing, Closed
- ❌ **Focus management** - Tab order, auto-focus
- ❌ **Validation** - Input validation framework
- ❌ **Error provider** - Visual validation feedback

#### 5. Event System
- ❌ **Typed events** - Click, Change, KeyPress, etc.
- ❌ **Event bubbling** - Parent/child event propagation
- ❌ **Event handlers in XML** - `onClick="handler"`
- ❌ **Lifecycle hooks** - onLoad, onShown, onClosing

#### 6. Data Binding
- ❌ **Property binding** - Bind control to data object
- ❌ **Two-way binding** - Control ↔ Data sync
- ❌ **Binding context** - Data context for forms
- ❌ **Data validation** - Validate on bind

#### 7. Layout Properties
- ❌ **Dock** - Top, Bottom, Left, Right, Fill
- ❌ **Anchor** - Top, Bottom, Left, Right combinations
- ❌ **AutoSize** - Size to content
- ❌ **Padding/Margin** - Spacing properties

#### 8. Window Management
- ❌ **Window state** - Normal, Minimized, Maximized
- ❌ **Modal stack** - Multiple modal layers
- ❌ **Owner/owned** - Parent-child window relationships
- ❌ **MDI support** - Multiple document interface
- ❌ **Window manager** - Centralized window lifecycle

---

## Implementation Strategy

### Phase 1: Core Control Library (Foundation)

**Goal**: Basic input/output controls with event system

#### 1.1 Label Control
```xml
<Label text="Username:" />
<Label>Welcome User</Label>
<Label text="Status: Ready" style="color: green; font-weight: bold;" />
```

**Properties**:
- `text` - Display text
- `autoSize` - Auto-size to content (default: true)
- `textAlign` - Left, Center, Right

**Implementation**:
- Create `controls/labelControl.tsx`
- Render as `<span>` or `<label>`
- Apply text alignment via CSS
- Support inline text content

#### 1.2 TextBox Control
```xml
<TextBox value="John Doe" onChange="handleNameChange" />
<TextBox value="{username}" multiline="true" rows="5" />
<TextBox value="" placeholder="Enter password" password="true" />
```

**Properties**:
- `value` - Current text
- `multiline` - Single/multi-line
- `readOnly` - Read-only mode
- `password` - Password masking
- `placeholder` - Placeholder text
- `maxLength` - Max character count

**Events**:
- `onChange` - Text changed
- `onFocus` - Gained focus
- `onBlur` - Lost focus
- `onKeyPress` - Key pressed

**Implementation**:
- Create `controls/textBoxControl.tsx`
- Render as `<input>` or `<textarea>`
- Controlled component pattern
- Event handler mapping

#### 1.3 Button Control
```xml
<Button text="OK" onClick="handleOk" />
<Button onClick="handleSubmit">Submit Form</Button>
<Button text="Cancel" onClick="handleCancel" enabled="false" />
```

**Properties**:
- `text` - Button text
- `enabled` - Enable/disable (default: true)
- `default` - Default button (Enter key)

**Events**:
- `onClick` - Button clicked

**Implementation**:
- Create `controls/buttonControl.tsx`
- Render as `<button>`
- Disabled state styling
- Default button handling (Enter key)

#### 1.4 CheckBox Control
```xml
<CheckBox text="Remember me" checked="true" onChange="handleRemember" />
<CheckBox checked="{isAdmin}" text="Admin" />
```

**Properties**:
- `text` - Label text
- `checked` - Checked state
- `enabled` - Enable/disable

**Events**:
- `onChange` - Check state changed

#### 1.5 RadioButton Control
```xml
<RadioButton text="Option A" group="options" checked="true" />
<RadioButton text="Option B" group="options" />
<RadioButton text="Option C" group="options" />
```

**Properties**:
- `text` - Label text
- `group` - Group name (mutual exclusion)
- `checked` - Checked state

**Events**:
- `onChange` - Selection changed

### Phase 2: Event System Architecture

#### 2.1 Event Registration
**XML Declaration**:
```xml
<Form onLoad="formLoad">
  <Button text="Click Me" onClick="buttonClick" />
</Form>
```

**Event Handler Registration**:
```typescript
// In FormRenderer or parent component
const eventHandlers = {
  formLoad: (e: FormEvent) => { console.log('Form loaded'); },
  buttonClick: (e: MouseEvent) => { console.log('Button clicked'); }
};

// Pass to renderer
<FormRenderer xml={xmlContent} handlers={eventHandlers} />
```

#### 2.2 Event Context
Extend `ControlContext` to include event handlers:
```typescript
interface ControlContext {
  DraggableContainer: ComponentType;
  renderChildren: (nodes: XMLNode[]) => ReactNode;
  resolveStyle: (props: any) => CSSProperties;
  resolveLayoutStyle: (layout: any) => CSSProperties;
  eventHandlers: Record<string, Function>; // NEW
  raiseEvent: (name: string, args: any) => void; // NEW
}
```

#### 2.3 Lifecycle Events
```typescript
// Form lifecycle
interface FormLifecycle {
  onLoad: () => void;      // Before first render
  onShown: () => void;     // After first render
  onClosing: (e: FormClosingEvent) => void; // Before close (cancellable)
  onClosed: () => void;    // After close
}
```

### Phase 3: Layout Containers

#### 3.1 FlowLayoutPanel
```xml
<FlowLayoutPanel direction="horizontal" wrap="true">
  <Button text="Button 1" />
  <Button text="Button 2" />
  <Button text="Button 3" />
</FlowLayoutPanel>
```

**Properties**:
- `direction` - Horizontal, Vertical
- `wrap` - Wrap to next line

**Implementation**:
- CSS Flexbox: `display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;`
- `flex-direction: row` or `column`

#### 3.2 TableLayoutPanel
```xml
<TableLayoutPanel rows="2" cols="2">
  <Label text="Name:" row="0" col="0" />
  <TextBox value="" row="0" col="1" />
  <Label text="Email:" row="1" col="0" />
  <TextBox value="" row="1" col="1" />
</TableLayoutPanel>
```

**Properties**:
- `rows` - Number of rows
- `cols` - Number of columns
- Child `row`, `col` - Cell position
- Child `rowSpan`, `colSpan` - Cell spanning

**Implementation**:
- CSS Grid: `display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(N, 1fr);`

#### 3.3 SplitContainer
```xml
<SplitContainer orientation="horizontal" splitPosition="50%">
  <Panel>Left Panel</Panel>
  <Panel>Right Panel</Panel>
</SplitContainer>
```

**Properties**:
- `orientation` - Horizontal, Vertical
- `splitPosition` - Initial split (px or %)
- `fixedPanel` - Panel1, Panel2, None

**Implementation**:
- Two divs with draggable splitter
- Mouse drag to resize
- Save position in state

#### 3.4 GroupBox
```xml
<GroupBox text="User Information">
  <Label text="Name:" />
  <TextBox value="" />
</GroupBox>
```

**Properties**:
- `text` - Group title

**Implementation**:
- `<fieldset>` with `<legend>`
- Or custom styled div with title

### Phase 4: Layout Properties System

#### 4.1 Dock Property
```xml
<Panel dock="top" height="50">
  <Label text="Header" />
</Panel>
<Panel dock="fill">
  <Label text="Content" />
</Panel>
<Panel dock="bottom" height="30">
  <Label text="Footer" />
</Panel>
```

**Values**: None, Top, Bottom, Left, Right, Fill

**Implementation**:
- Parent container: `position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column;`
- Top: `position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;`
- Bottom: `position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;`
- Fill: `flex: 1;`

#### 4.2 Anchor Property
```xml
<Button text="OK" anchor="bottom,right" />
```

**Values**: Top, Bottom, Left, Right (bitwise combination)

**Implementation**:
- Parent container: `position: relative;`
- Anchored control: `position: absolute;`
- Top+Left: `top: 10px; left: 10px;`
- Bottom+Right: `bottom: 10px; right: 10px;`
- Top+Bottom: `top: 10px; bottom: 10px; height: auto;`

### Phase 5: Dialog and Window Management

#### 5.1 Modal Dialog System
```typescript
// In code (not XML)
const result = await showDialog({
  title: 'Confirm',
  content: <Label text="Are you sure?" />,
  buttons: ['OK', 'Cancel']
});

if (result === 'OK') {
  // Handle OK
}
```

**Implementation**:
- Dialog manager component
- Overlay/backdrop
- Modal stack (multiple dialogs)
- Focus trap
- ESC to close

#### 5.2 Window Manager
```typescript
interface WindowManager {
  openWindow(config: WindowConfig): WindowHandle;
  closeWindow(handle: WindowHandle): void;
  minimizeWindow(handle: WindowHandle): void;
  maximizeWindow(handle: WindowHandle): void;
  bringToFront(handle: WindowHandle): void;
}
```

**Features**:
- Window registry
- Z-index management
- Minimize to taskbar
- Maximize/restore
- Window state persistence

### Phase 6: Data Binding

#### 6.1 Simple Binding
```xml
<Form binding="{formData}">
  <Label text="Name:" />
  <TextBox binding="name" />
  <Label text="Age:" />
  <TextBox binding="age" type="number" />
</Form>
```

**Implementation**:
- Binding context provider
- Two-way binding via onChange
- Automatic UI updates

#### 6.2 Binding Syntax
```typescript
interface BindingContext {
  data: any;
  update: (path: string, value: any) => void;
}

// In TextBox
const value = getNestedValue(context.data, props.binding);
const onChange = (newValue) => context.update(props.binding, newValue);
```

