# Pexels API Documentation

## Authentication

All requests to the Pexels API must include an `Authorization` header with your API key:

```bash
Authorization: YOUR_API_KEY
```

## Photos API

### The Photo Resource

The `Photo` resource is a JSON formatted version of a Pexels photo. All Photo API endpoints respond with photo data in this format.

**Response Fields:**

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `id` | integer | The id of the photo |
| `width` | integer | The real width of the photo in pixels |
| `height` | integer | The real height of the photo in pixels |
| `url` | string | The Pexels URL where the photo is located |
| `photographer` | string | The name of the photographer who took the photo |
| `photographer_url` | string | The URL of the photographer's Pexels profile |
| `photographer_id` | integer | The id of the photographer |
| `avg_color` | string | The average color of the photo. Useful for a placeholder while the image loads |
| `src` | object | An assortment of different image sizes that can be used to display this Photo |
| `alt` | string | Text description of the photo for use in the `alt` attribute |

**Example Photo Object:**

```json
{
  "id": 2014422,
  "width": 3024,
  "height": 3024,
  "url": "https://www.pexels.com/photo/brown-rocks-during-golden-hour-2014422/",
  "photographer": "Joey Farina",
  "photographer_url": "https://www.pexels.com/@joey",
  "photographer_id": 680589,
  "avg_color": "#978E82",
  "src": {
    "original": "https://images.pexels.com/photos/2014422/pexels-photo-2014422.jpeg",
    "large2x": "https://images.pexels.com/photos/2014422/pexels-photo-2014422.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&dpr=2&h=650&w=940",
    "large": "https://images.pexels.com/photos/2014422/pexels-photo-2014422.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=650&w=940",
    "medium": "https://images.pexels.com/photos/2014422/pexels-photo-2014422.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=350",
    "small": "https://images.pexels.com/photos/2014422/pexels-photo-2014422.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=130",
    "portrait": "https://images.pexels.com/photos/2014422/pexels-photo-2014422.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&fit=crop&h=1200&w=800",
    "landscape": "https://images.pexels.com/photos/2014422/pexels-photo-2014422.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&fit=crop&h=627&w=1200",
    "tiny": "https://images.pexels.com/photos/2014422/pexels-photo-2014422.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&dpr=1&fit=crop&h=200&w=280"
  },
  "liked": false,
  "alt": "Brown Rocks During Golden Hour"
}
```

### Search for Photos

`GET https://api.pexels.com/v1/search`

This endpoint enables you to search Pexels for any topic. Your query could be something broad like `Nature`, `Tigers`, `People`, or something specific like `Group of people working`.

**Parameters:**

| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
| `query` | string | required | The search query. `Ocean`, `Tigers`, `Pears`, etc. |
| `orientation` | string | optional | Desired photo orientation: `landscape`, `portrait`, or `square` |
| `size` | string | optional | Minimum photo size: `large` (24MP), `medium` (12MP), or `small` (4MP) |
| `color` | string | optional | Desired photo color: `red`, `orange`, `yellow`, `green`, `turquoise`, `blue`, `violet`, `pink`, `brown`, `black`, `gray`, `white`, or any hexadecimal color code (e.g., `#ffffff`) |
| `locale` | string | optional | Locale of the search: `en-US`, `pt-BR`, `es-ES`, `ca-ES`, `de-DE`, `it-IT`, `fr-FR`, `sv-SE`, `id-ID`, `pl-PL`, `ja-JP`, `zh-TW`, `zh-CN`, `ko-KR`, `th-TH`, `nl-NL`, `hu-HU`, `vi-VN`, `cs-CZ`, `da-DK`, `fi-FI`, `uk-UA`, `el-GR`, `ro-RO`, `nb-NO`, `sk-SK`, `tr-TR`, `ru-RU` |
| `page` | integer | optional | Page number you are requesting. Default: `1` |
| `per_page` | integer | optional | Number of results per page. Default: `15`, Max: `80` |

**Response:**

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `photos` | array of Photo | An array of Photo objects |
| `page` | integer | The current page number |
| `per_page` | integer | The number of results returned with each page |
| `total_results` | integer | The total number of results for the request |
| `prev_page` | string (optional) | URL for the previous page of results, if applicable |
| `next_page` | string (optional) | URL for the next page of results, if applicable |

**Example Request:**

```bash
curl -H "Authorization: YOUR_API_KEY" \
  "https://api.pexels.com/v1/search?query=nature&per_page=1"
```

**Example Response:**

```json
{
  "total_results": 10000,
  "page": 1,
  "per_page": 1,
  "photos": [
    {
      "id": 3573351,
      "width": 3066,
      "height": 3968,
      "url": "https://www.pexels.com/photo/trees-during-day-3573351/",
      "photographer": "Lukas Rodriguez",
      "photographer_url": "https://www.pexels.com/@lukas-rodriguez-1845331",
      "photographer_id": 1845331,
      "avg_color": "#374824",
      "src": {
        "original": "https://images.pexels.com/photos/3573351/pexels-photo-3573351.png",
        "large2x": "https://images.pexels.com/photos/3573351/pexels-photo-3573351.png?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&dpr=2&h=650&w=940",
        "large": "https://images.pexels.com/photos/3573351/pexels-photo-3573351.png?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=650&w=940",
        "medium": "https://images.pexels.com/photos/3573351/pexels-photo-3573351.png?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=350",
        "small": "https://images.pexels.com/photos/3573351/pexels-photo-3573351.png?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=130",
        "portrait": "https://images.pexels.com/photos/3573351/pexels-photo-3573351.png?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&fit=crop&h=1200&w=800",
        "landscape": "https://images.pexels.com/photos/3573351/pexels-photo-3573351.png?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&fit=crop&h=627&w=1200",
        "tiny": "https://images.pexels.com/photos/3573351/pexels-photo-3573351.png?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&dpr=1&fit=crop&h=200&w=280"
      },
      "liked": false,
      "alt": "Brown Rocks During Golden Hour"
    }
  ],
  "next_page": "https://api.pexels.com/v1/search/?page=2&per_page=1&query=nature"
}
```

### Curated Photos

`GET https://api.pexels.com/v1/curated`

This endpoint enables you to receive real-time photos curated by the Pexels team. We add at least one new photo per hour to our curated list so that you always get a changing selection of trending photos.

**Parameters:**

| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
| `page` | integer | optional | Page number you are requesting. Default: `1` |
| `per_page` | integer | optional | Number of results per page. Default: `15`, Max: `80` |

**Response:**

Same as Search for Photos endpoint.

**Example Request:**

```bash
curl -H "Authorization: YOUR_API_KEY" \
  "https://api.pexels.com/v1/curated?per_page=1"
```

### Get a Photo

`GET https://api.pexels.com/v1/photos/:id`

Retrieve a specific Photo from its id.

**Parameters:**

| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
| `id` | integer | required | The id of the photo you are requesting |

**Response:**

Returns a `Photo` object.

**Example Request:**

```bash
curl -H "Authorization: YOUR_API_KEY" \
  "https://api.pexels.com/v1/photos/2014422"
```

## Videos API

### The Video Resource

The `Video` resource is a JSON formatted version of a Pexels video. All Video API endpoints respond with video data in this format.

**Response Fields:**

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `id` | integer | The id of the video |
| `width` | integer | The real width of the video in pixels |
| `height` | integer | The real height of the video in pixels |
| `url` | string | The Pexels URL where the video is located |
| `image` | string | URL to a screenshot of the video |
| `duration` | integer | The duration of the video in seconds |
| `user` | object | The videographer who shot the video |
| `video_files` | Array of objects | An array of different sized versions of the video |
| `video_pictures` | Array of objects | An array of preview pictures of the video |

**Example Video Object:**

```json
{
  "id": 2499611,
  "width": 1080,
  "height": 1920,
  "url": "https://www.pexels.com/video/2499611/",
  "image": "https://images.pexels.com/videos/2499611/free-video-2499611.jpg?fit=crop&w=1200&h=630&auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb",
  "full_res": null,
  "tags": [],
  "duration": 22,
  "user": {
    "id": 680589,
    "name": "Joey Farina",
    "url": "https://www.pexels.com/@joey"
  },
  "video_files": [
    {
      "id": 125004,
      "quality": "hd",
      "file_type": "video/mp4",
      "width": 1080,
      "height": 1920,
      "fps": 23.976,
      "link": "https://player.vimeo.com/external/342571552.hd.mp4?s=..."
    },
    {
      "id": 125005,
      "quality": "sd",
      "file_type": "video/mp4",
      "width": 540,
      "height": 960,
      "fps": 23.976,
      "link": "https://player.vimeo.com/external/342571552.sd.mp4?s=..."
    },
    {
      "id": 125006,
      "quality": "sd",
      "file_type": "video/mp4",
      "width": 240,
      "height": 426,
      "fps": 23.976,
      "link": "https://player.vimeo.com/external/342571552.sd.mp4?s=..."
    }
  ],
  "video_pictures": [
    {
      "id": 308178,
      "picture": "https://images.pexels.com/videos/2499611/pictures/preview-0.jpg",
      "nr": 0
    }
  ]
}
```

### Search for Videos

`GET https://api.pexels.com/videos/search`

This endpoint enables you to search Pexels for any video topic.

**Parameters:**

| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
| `query` | string | required | The search query |
| `orientation` | string | optional | Desired video orientation: `landscape`, `portrait`, or `square` |
| `size` | string | optional | Minimum video size: `large` (4K), `medium` (Full HD), or `small` (HD) |
| `locale` | string | optional | Same locales as Photos API |
| `page` | integer | optional | Page number. Default: `1` |
| `per_page` | integer | optional | Results per page. Default: `15`, Max: `80` |

**Response:**

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `videos` | array of Video | An array of Video objects |
| `page` | integer | The current page number |
| `per_page` | integer | The number of results returned with each page |
| `total_results` | integer | The total number of results |
| `prev_page` | string (optional) | URL for the previous page |
| `next_page` | string (optional) | URL for the next page |

**Example Request:**

```bash
curl -H "Authorization: YOUR_API_KEY" \
  "https://api.pexels.com/videos/search?query=nature&per_page=1"
```

### Popular Videos

`GET https://api.pexels.com/videos/popular`

This endpoint enables you to receive the current popular Pexels videos.

**Parameters:**

| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
| `min_width` | integer | optional | Minimum width in pixels |
| `min_height` | integer | optional | Minimum height in pixels |
| `min_duration` | integer | optional | Minimum duration in seconds |
| `max_duration` | integer | optional | Maximum duration in seconds |
| `page` | integer | optional | Page number. Default: `1` |
| `per_page` | integer | optional | Results per page. Default: `15`, Max: `80` |

**Response:**

Same as Search for Videos endpoint.

**Example Request:**

```bash
curl -H "Authorization: YOUR_API_KEY" \
  "https://api.pexels.com/videos/popular?per_page=1"
```

### Get a Video

`GET https://api.pexels.com/videos/videos/:id`

Retrieve a specific Video from its id.

**Parameters:**

| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
| `id` | integer | required | The id of the video you are requesting |

**Response:**

Returns a `Video` object.

**Example Request:**

```bash
curl -H "Authorization: YOUR_API_KEY" \
